  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Camo US Flag T-Shirt is the perfect way to showcase your patriotic spirit. This graphic shirt features prominently displayed distressed USA flags on both the chest and sleeve, making a bold statement wherever you go. Constructed from a comfortable and durable 60% cotton / 40% polyester blend, this camo t-shirt is designed to last for years. The tag-less label ensures added comfort, preventing irritation during wear. Ideal for a variety of activities including exercise, outdoor sports, and casual wear, this American flag t-shirt combines style, comfort, and functionality. Whether you're hitting the gym, engaging in a team sport, or just enjoying a casual day out, Rothco's Camo US Flag T-Shirt is your go-to choice for expressing your love for the USA.</p>",
